    "notes": [
      "Apply only after xdm_android_browser_removal_phase8d_media_resolver_format_selection_overlay.zip.",
      "Adds Overview, Timeline, Attention, Decisions, Queues, Schedule, Recovery, and Diagnostics panels inside the existing Activity destination; no new top-level route is introduced.",
